{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Scarecrow",
    "steam_appid": 2280360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/485eb45ddcb2d1d8c297547c0ee01370.poster.avif?t=1746977308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/485eb45ddcb2d1d8c297547c0ee01370.webm?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hitman fox with a shadowy backstory. Your job is to eliminate crime bosses and leaders of local gangs. In other words, to rub the nuisances out of your client's list. What could possibly go wrong? <strong>And more importantly \u2013 who stands behind these contracts in actual fact?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, roam the vibey town, philosophize about the meaning of life with local hobos and hang out at a bar with your friends. By night, do your &quot;job&quot; with precision: ruthlessly take down anyone who gets in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/4d6f500d21632c6feed4b482f82d1dfe.poster.avif?t=1746977308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/4d6f500d21632c6feed4b482f82d1dfe.webm?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/4d6f500d21632c6feed4b482f82d1dfe.mp4?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The game is developed without external funding by a small independent team of four.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A unique blend of radically different genres that will give you a fresh gaming experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Dynamic Combat: each fight requires its own approach.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Awesome Soundtrack: from energetic dubstep to acoustic guitar melodies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Get wasted with friends, battle with toy guns to heavy electronic beats, and much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1746977308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scarecrow consists of three chapters. The first chapter introduces you to the game world and its core mechanics. In the following two chapters, the story unfolds further. All chapters are included in the game\u2019s price and will be automatically added as they are released.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/485eb45ddcb2d1d8c297547c0ee01370.poster.avif?t=1746977308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/485eb45ddcb2d1d8c297547c0ee01370.webm?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hitman fox with a shadowy backstory. Your job is to eliminate crime bosses and leaders of local gangs. In other words, to rub the nuisances out of your client's list. What could possibly go wrong? <strong>And more importantly \u2013 who stands behind these contracts in actual fact?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, roam the vibey town, philosophize about the meaning of life with local hobos and hang out at a bar with your friends. By night, do your &quot;job&quot; with precision: ruthlessly take down anyone who gets in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/4d6f500d21632c6feed4b482f82d1dfe.poster.avif?t=1746977308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/4d6f500d21632c6feed4b482f82d1dfe.webm?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/4d6f500d21632c6feed4b482f82d1dfe.mp4?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The game is developed without external funding by a small independent team of four.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A unique blend of radically different genres that will give you a fresh gaming experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Dynamic Combat: each fight requires its own approach.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Awesome Soundtrack: from energetic dubstep to acoustic guitar melodies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Get wasted with friends, battle with toy guns to heavy electronic beats, and much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1746977308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280360/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1746977308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scarecrow consists of three chapters. The first chapter introduces you to the game world and its core mechanics. In the following two chapters, the story unfolds further. All chapters are included in the game\u2019s price and will be automatically added as they are released.</i></p>",
